{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24589","headline":"遇物感兴因示子弟 · 白居易","name":"遇物感兴因示子弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣择狂夫言，俗信老人语。\n我有老狂词，听之吾语汝。\n吾观器用中，劒锐锋多伤。\n吾观形骸内，骨劲齿先亡。\n寄言处世者，不可苦刚强。\n龟性愚且善，鸠心钝无恶。\n人贱拾支牀，鹘欺擒暖脚。\n寄言立身者，不得全柔弱。\n彼固罹祸难，此未免忧患。\n于何保终吉，强弱刚柔间。\n上遵周孔训，旁鉴老庄言。\n不唯鞭其後，亦要轭其先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}